WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.121
You have GESY.

2
00:00:02.145 --> 00:00:04.640
Do you also need private health insurance?

3
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.665
GESY covers a wide range of services:

4
00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:13.947
a personal doctor, specialists, tests, medicines and hospital care.

5
00:00:14.413 --> 00:00:16.560
A private plan does not replace it;

6
00:00:16.560 --> 00:00:18.011
it adds to it.

7
00:00:19.111 --> 00:00:23.510
It matters if you want treatment outside GESY, cover abroad,

8
00:00:23.639 --> 00:00:27.527
more comfort in hospital or flexibility over when you are treated.

9
00:00:28.627 --> 00:00:32.132
Before you choose, check the annual limit, the deductible,

10
00:00:32.319 --> 00:00:36.161
the waiting periods, and what applies to conditions you already have.

11
00:00:37.261 --> 00:00:38.351
And take care:

12
00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:41.486
if you stop one plan to start another later,

13
00:00:41.731 --> 00:00:45.538
conditions that appeared in between may be excluded.

14
00:00:46.638 --> 00:00:49.702
See how ready your family is for a serious medical cost,

15
00:00:50.005 --> 00:00:52.686
with the free check on avrastro.com.
